  "title": "SupplierQueuePage reject modal custom implementation instead of shared Modal component",
  "description": "R6 deep audit finding. Dimension: UI. Severity: P3. Source SHA: bbd487a3. Scope: R6_DEEP_AUDIT_WAVE. SupplierQueuePage implements its own modal overlay (lines 275-331) with raw div + inline styles instead of using the shared Modal component (components/Modal.tsx). This means: (1) No Escape key dismissal (the shared Modal has it), (2) No consistent styling with other modals in the app, (3) The overlay onClick closes the modal but no keyboard accessibility is provided. The same pattern appears in ProductQueuePage (lines 441-660 for edit modal, 663-719 for reject modal).",
